2026-09-25 M2 review R3-F2: a Form 4/A replaces only the same-day original it amends: the one sharing a trade date with it, else the only one that day (a corrected trade date), else the nearest in trade date; the insider's other same-day Form 4s still count, and the latest amendment of an original wins.
